# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitize profile (run_tests.py and
# samples/run_samples.py pass this file). cute_spirv's parser keeps its
# syntax tree's lists in ckit arrays it never frees; third_party/cute_spirv
# is a copy kept unmodified, so its leaks are suppressed rather than fixed
# there.
leak:cute_spirv.h
# Line-table-only Clang stacks identify these same parser allocations at
# their inlined ckit.h allocation sites. Keep matches specific to the bundled
# shader functions; no general allocator, ckit.h, or compiler suppression.
leak:cspv_parse_unary
leak:cspv_parse_block
leak:cspv_gen_top_level
leak:ck_map_ensure_capacity
